    "f-collapsible-tab-1714725352fRAFx-heading_html": "Earn shopping credits",
    "f-collapsible-tab-1714725352fRAFx-content_html": "Members can accumulate up to USD $600 shopping credits (upon successful transactions made by all 20 referrals) for purchases on thefuturerocks.com within the first year of membership registration.<br /><br /><em>Example: Person A registered for the Rock On program on 30th June, 2024, and successfully referred 20 customers (with order delivered) within a year. USD $600 worth of shopping credits will expire by 30th June, 2025.</em>",
    "f-collapsible-tab-1714725353NxQ4b-heading_html": "Get more with less",
